{"id":"0842809a20d60f94","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-subformula-property.md","title":"Subformula Property","display":"thm-subformula-property — Subformula Property","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-subformula-property","aliases":["72-thm-subformula-property"],"display":"thm-subformula-property — Subformula Property","depends_on":["[[72-df-gentzen-system]]","[[72-df-proof-tree]]","[[72-df-subformula-property]]"],"chapter":"I","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I Proposition1.2.4 print13/PDF25","verification_status":"source-statement-checked; propositional rule-by-rule argument checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-subformula-property"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-subformula-property</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-subformula-property — Subformula Property"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c60a11e47ac58326\" href=\"?note=c60a11e47ac58326\" title=\"72-df-gentzen-system\">72-df-gentzen-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"81c9c855e009a6d4\" href=\"?note=81c9c855e009a6d4\" title=\"72-df-proof-tree\">72-df-proof-tree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"48c1180d4b0f90db\" href=\"?note=48c1180d4b0f90db\" title=\"72-df-subformula-property\">72-df-subformula-property</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"I"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I Proposition1.2.4 print13/PDF25"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked; propositional rule-by-rule argument checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"thm-subformula-property-—-Subformula-property\">thm-subformula-property — Subformula-property</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LK}^{-}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LK}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LJ}^{-}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LJ}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathrm{LK}^{-}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LK}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LJ}^{-}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LJ}_\\Sigma\\)</span> 均取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c60a11e47ac58326\" href=\"?note=c60a11e47ac58326\" title=\"72-df-gentzen-system\">72-df-gentzen-system</a> 的实际序列演算；没有另加非逻辑初始式，逻辑等号没有额外公理。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Proof}_\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathrm{Proof}_\\mathcal C\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"81c9c855e009a6d4\" href=\"?note=81c9c855e009a6d4\" title=\"72-df-proof-tree\">72-df-proof-tree</a> 的有限五元带标签证明集合。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathrm{LK}^{-}_\\Sigma}\">\\(\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathrm{LK}^{-}_\\Sigma}\\)</span>，各相继式标签中的每个公式都无量词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubformulaProperty}\">\\(\\operatorname{SubformulaProperty}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"48c1180d4b0f90db\" href=\"?note=48c1180d4b0f90db\" title=\"72-df-subformula-property\">72-df-subformula-property</a> 的扩充语法版本。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubformulaProperty}(\\pi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubformulaProperty}(\\pi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应源Proposition1.2.4的cut-free PK。由根向叶逐规则检查：所有辅助公式为主公式子公式，侧公式保持；有限分支复合给结论。一般一阶版本需子公式实例关系，不能用字面Sf代替。现在已消除旧pending-LK-interface标记，因为相关序列、逻辑规则及ProofTree均已有真实定义；没有扩展此定理的命题片段范围。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-subformula-property-—-Subformula-property","text":"thm-subformula-property — Subformula-property","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-gentzen-system","status":"resolved","id":"c60a11e47ac58326","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-gentzen-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-proof-tree","status":"resolved","id":"81c9c855e009a6d4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-proof-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-subformula-property","status":"resolved","id":"48c1180d4b0f90db","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-subformula-property]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-gentzen-system","status":"resolved","id":"c60a11e47ac58326","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma$、$\\mathrm{LK}^{-}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LK}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LJ}^{-}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LJ}_\\Sigma$ 均取 [[72-df-gentzen-system]] 的实际序列演算；没有另加非逻辑初始式，逻辑等号没有额外公理。$\\mathrm{Proof}_\\mathcal C$ 是 [[72-df-proof-tree]] 的有限五元带标签证明集合。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-proof-tree","status":"resolved","id":"81c9c855e009a6d4","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma$、$\\mathrm{LK}^{-}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LK}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LJ}^{-}_\\Sigma,\\mathrm{LJ}_\\Sigma$ 均取 [[72-df-gentzen-system]] 的实际序列演算；没有另加非逻辑初始式，逻辑等号没有额外公理。$\\mathrm{Proof}_\\mathcal C$ 是 [[72-df-proof-tree]] 的有限五元带标签证明集合。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-subformula-property","status":"resolved","id":"48c1180d4b0f90db","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\pi\\in